@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001

### T00 Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### T01 View all warehouses
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/warehouses

### T02 Create a valid warehouse (expect 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/warehouses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alexandria Warehouse",
  "location": "Alexandria"
}

### T03 Missing name (expect 400 VALIDATION_ERROR)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/warehouses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "location": "Giza"
}

### T04 Location too short (expect 400 VALIDATION_ERROR)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/warehouses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Giza Warehouse",
  "location": "G"
}

### T05 Wrong content type (expect 415 UNSUPPORTED_MEDIA_TYPE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/warehouses
Content-Type: text/plain

name=Giza Warehouse

### T06 Unknown route (expect 404 ROUTE_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/unknown
